  ("29-35","SUN","Your blood pressure pills are your doctor's decision. Not mine. Not the internet's.","Meds = your doctor","same | points spoon at camera | CU"),
  ("35-40","SUN","Comment SOUP. I'll send you three of my soups.","Comment SOUP","same | stirs pot, smiles | medium"),
