  ("18-26","SUN","Chop them into oatmeal. Or eat them with walnuts at four o'clock.","Oatmeal · or with walnuts",f"{K} | chopping prunes into oats | overhead"),
  ("26-32","SUN","They're sweet, so count them if you have diabetes. And they move things along. Start with three, go up slowly, and drink water.","Diabetes? Count them · start with 3","same | CU | CU"),
  ("32-35","CHANG","I lift for my bones.","","same | Chang flexes in doorway | two-shot"),
  ("35-40","SUN","You lift for the mirror. Comment GUT for my fiber ladder.","Comment GUT","same | smirk | medium"),
